Third-party material (not covered by the license above)

The MIT license covers this project's own code and its hand-written content
(hero pitches, ability one-liners, quiz questions and trait scores, team fits
and cross-game matches). It does not cover material owned by others, which
stays the property of its owners and is used here in an unofficial fan project:

- Deadlock game assets and data, (c) Valve Corporation: hero cards, renders,
  name marks, ability icons, fonts, UI art, sounds and voice lines (everything
  under site/img/, plus site/favicon.png and site/og.jpg), and the hero names,
  stats, ability texts, lore and voice-line texts taken from the game files.
- Characters and portraits from other games, (c) their respective owners,
  including Blizzard Entertainment (Overwatch), NetEase Games and Marvel
  (Marvel Rivals), Riot Games (Valorant, League of Legends) and Electronic Arts
  and Respawn Entertainment (Apex Legends): everything under xg/*/img/ and
  xg/val/icons/.
- Screenshots of the site in .github/assets/, which show the material above.
